🚀 Week 7 – Day 5 Project: Multi-PDF Chatbot 📄🤖

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧠 Project Overview

Build a chatbot that can answer questions from **multiple PDF documents** using **RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)**.

Users can upload several PDFs, and the chatbot will:

✔ Extract text
✔ Split documents into chunks
✔ Generate embeddings
✔ Store vectors in a vector database
✔ Retrieve relevant chunks
✔ Generate grounded answers using an LLM

